        <p>
<bold>Dosing Adjustments and Special Populations</bold>
</p>
        <p>
<bold>Renal Impairment Considerations</bold>
</p>
        <p>In patients with severe renal impairment, certain obesity medications may require dose adjustments or may be contraindicated.&#x000a0;(see <bold>Table 14</bold>).</p>
