        <p>
<bold>Hepatic impairment considerations</bold>
</p>
        <p>In patients with severe hepatic impairment,&#x000a0;certain obesity medications may require dose adjustments or may be contraindicated. (see&#x000a0;<bold>Table 15</bold>).</p>
